<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's PSCI stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's PSCI stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSC Industries Bhd's stock was suspended on Thursday for a company announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange (KLSE) said.</p>
<p>An official at PSC, which is involved in shipbuilding and repairing, among other activities, said the news is not yet ready for release. He declined to offer details.</p>
<p>PSC stock closed at 34 ringgit on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
